What is HomeOS?
HomeOS is the world's first AI-Powered Digital Property Twin and Household Intelligence Platform.
Every home receives its own intelligent digital identity.
We call this the Digital Property Twin.
The Digital Twin is not simply a database.
It is a living AI model of the property.
It continuously learns from every document, bill, payment, maintenance activity, renovation, appliance, warranty, tenant, and financial transaction.
Instead of storing information,
it understands information.

How It Works
Whenever a homeowner uploads a document—
an electricity bill,
an insurance policy,
a property tax receipt,
a loan agreement,
or even a handwritten maintenance invoice—
AI automatically extracts every important detail.
It identifies:
Owner information
Property details
Survey number
Registration dates
Due dates
Expiry dates
Utility information
Financial values
Service providers
The extracted knowledge doesn't remain inside that document.
It becomes part of the property's memory.
Every uploaded file makes the Digital Twin smarter.

The Property Starts Thinking
Because the property now understands itself,
it can answer questions.
Instead of searching folders,
the homeowner simply asks:
"When was my water tank repaired?"
"How much have I spent on maintenance over the last five years?"
"Which insurance expires next month?"
"How much rent did this property generate last year?"
"Compare my Pune flat and my agricultural land."
The AI already knows.

Beyond Storage: Intelligence
Traditional software tells users what has happened.
HomeOS tells users what will happen next.
Instead of saying
"Your AC service is due tomorrow,"
HomeOS analyses usage history, previous maintenance records, warranty information, and manufacturer recommendations.
It predicts:
"Your compressor has an 82% probability of failure within the next three months. Servicing now could prevent approximately ₹12,000 in repair costs."
This transforms maintenance from reactive to proactive.

